  "body": "An excellent opportunity to secure a generous 577m² section at Anehana Heights, Whangaparaoa — now priced at just $650,000.\r\n\r\nLot 28 offers plenty of space to create a quality standalone home in an established coastal community.\r\n\r\nContact Graeme Sun on 021 856 116 for further information\r\nEmail: gsun@neilgroup.co.nz\r\n\r\nWith sections of this size becoming increasingly difficult to find across Auckland, this is an opportunity for home buyers, builders or investors looking for genuine land value on the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\n•\tLot 28 – 577m² \r\n•\tPrice: $650,000 including GST \r\n•\tGenerous standalone residential section \r\n•\tEstablished Whangaparaoa location \r\n\r\nSecure the land now and build when you are ready.\r\nContact Graeme Sun on 021 856 116 for further information",
